---
import { TextSection } from '@components/odyssey-theme';
import Layout from '../../layouts/Page.astro';

const seo = {
  title: `Legal | Mountaineer.fi`,
  description: `Mountaineer.fi terms of service and privacy policy.`,
};
---

<Layout seo={seo}>
  <TextSection narrow>
    <h1>Legal &amp; Terms</h1>

    <h2>Terms of Service</h2>

    <p>Welcome to Mountaineer.fi. By accessing this website, you agree to these terms of service. Our platform is dedicated to preserving the legacy of Himalayan exploration through authentic storytelling and historical documentation.</p>

    <p>All content published on Mountaineer.fi is for informational and educational purposes. We strive to maintain accuracy in our historical records but encourage readers to verify details from primary sources when possible.</p>

    <p>User-contributed stories and content must respect the history and traditions of mountaineering. We reserve the right to moderate content that does not align with our values of authenticity, respect, and accuracy.</p>

    <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>

    <p>Mountaineer.fi respects your privacy. We collect minimal information necessary to improve your experience on our platform. We do not sell or share personal data with third parties.</p>

    <p>Any information you provide through our contact forms is used solely for communication purposes and is not shared with external parties without your explicit consent.</p>

    <p>We use standard analytics to understand how visitors interact with our site, helping us improve the experience for the mountaineering community we serve.</p>
  </TextSection>
</Layout>